  message: "ADR-0028 (fully landed) shipped Edge.is_resolved at ir.py:399 with default True. Cross-linker integration consuming resolution state — the Phase 5 deliverable for the Return-Type Registry — is no longer gated on any ADR work. Deliverables (1) type_hierarchy fallback for ambiguous receivers and (2) dataflow refinement for chained call access_mode can both read edge.is_resolved directly rather than parsing *_unresolved evidence strings. The 'only after Phases 1-4 are validated against deep-bakeoff metrics' gate still applies (this item is OPTIONAL by design), but the ADR-side prerequisites are clear."  # ac39
